                <pb facs="0621" n="587" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg587"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 1268.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to the Stamford Manufacturing
                        Company.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-28"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 28,
                        1897</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Turkish Government has been requested to give further time for the departure
                    of Greeks in your employ.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
